!set nova_sv_aide=Scores out of 10 on the current exercise: red below the difficulty threshold, green from the success threshold. A signal invites you to go and see the student; it says nothing about their intentions. &quot;No action&quot; does not mean logged out, and an open session does not guarantee that the student is at the screen. Answers that are not counted are included when WIMS logs them.
